{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 500000, "duration": 65640778, "text": "That assessment is excellent at answering the cloud-era question: where and how should this application run in Azure?"}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 66140778, "duration": 66504856, "text": "But customers increasingly ask a second question: how can I use A I in this existing application?"}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 132645634, "duration": 52912622, "text": "And, if I already use A I on-premises, how should I modernize that capability in Azure?"}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 185558257, "duration": 25970874, "text": "This leads to two strategic questions."}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 211529132, "duration": 53883496, "text": "How do we help customers find credible A I opportunities in the applications they already own?"}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 265412628, "duration": 51699030, "text": "And what should the next generation of Azure Migrate look like in the A I era?"}
